  "content": "<p>用于创建多面地毯的简单库。</p><p>特性：</p><ul>\n<li>包含一个可放置在地面/墙壁/天花板上的多部件方块基类；</li>\n<li>实现了用多部件方块替换方块的逻辑；</li>\n<li>提供模型/方块状态/战利品表的数据生成辅助工具；</li>\n<li>支持 NeoForge/Fabric。</li>\n</ul><p>设计理念是什么？使用此库，您可以快速高效地创建扁平多部件方块。</p><p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1140721.svg\" alt=\"版本信息\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"NeoForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"Forge\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcarpets-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon 捐款\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi 捐款\"></a></p><p>查看我的其他模组：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"地毯变种\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"铜装饰\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"生物战利品变种\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"更好的方块音效（分叉版）\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"史莱姆大修\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"多语言\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"大水\"></a></p>",
